@abstract:
Trust and provenance verification for Neurophone.
Maximal trust by default — LLM agents may read, build, test, lint, format.
@end

@trust-level: maximal
@trust-boundary: repo
@trust-actions: [read, build, test, lint, format, commit, push, create-pr]
@trust-deny: [delete-branch, force-push, modify-ci-secrets, publish, merge-to-main-without-ci]

## Integrity

### license-content
- description: LICENSE contains MPL-2.0 identifier
- run: grep -q 'Mozilla Public License\|MPL-2.0\|MPL 2.0' LICENSE
- severity: critical

### no-secrets-committed
- description: No .env or credential files in repo
- run: test ! -f .env && test ! -f credentials.json && test ! -f .env.local
- severity: critical

### cargo-lock-clean
- description: Cargo.lock must be present and not contain obviously insecure entries
- run: test -f Cargo.lock
- severity: critical

### sha-pinned-actions
- description: GitHub Actions must use SHA pins, not floating tags (checked by workflow-linter.yml)
- run: grep -rn 'uses:.*@[a-f0-9]\{40\}' .github/workflows/ | head -1 | grep -q .
- severity: warning

## Gossamer Boundary

### no-new-kotlin-outside-android
- description: No new Kotlin files outside the android/ exemption directory
- run: "! find . -name '*.kt' -not -path './android/*' -not -path './.git/*' 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep ."
- severity: critical

### android-exemption-tracked
- description: android/** Kotlin exemption is documented in hypatia baseline
- run: grep -q 'android' .hypatia-baseline.json
- severity: warning

## Dependency Provenance

### rand-version-locked
- description: rand must be pinned to 0.9.x (ndarray-rand 0.16 compatibility)
- run: grep -q 'rand = "0.9' Cargo.toml
- severity: warning

### rand-distr-version-locked
- description: rand_distr must be pinned to 0.5.x (ndarray-rand 0.16 compatibility)
- run: grep -q 'rand_distr = "0.5' Cargo.toml
- severity: warning
